# ClassicGuide - Human start: Northshire Valley and Elwynn Forest (1-12), WoW Classic Era
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.
# Adapted from TBCGuide's Elwynn route (same author). Level bands cross-checked against Joana's Classic
# 1-12 Elwynn guide (joanasworld.com), research only: no text or step order copied.

@guide A_Human_Elwynn
@name Northshire & Elwynn Forest
@faction Alliance
@races Human
@levels 1-12
@zone Elwynn Forest
@chapter Azeroth
@start
@desc Human starting route. Northshire Valley to level 5, then Goldshire, the Stonefield and Maclure farms, Eastvale and Westbrook, with class quests and trainers in Stormwind at 10. Ends at 12.
@next A_Westfall

accept A Threat Within
turnin A Threat Within
accept Kobold Camp Cleanup
accept Eagan Peltskinner
turnin Eagan Peltskinner
accept Wolves Across the Border
complete Kobold Camp Cleanup | Kobold Vermin are in the camp just north-west of the abbey.
complete Wolves Across the Border | Kill wolves around the valley for Tough Wolf Meat.
turnin Wolves Across the Border
turnin Kobold Camp Cleanup
accept Investigate Echo Ridge
accept 3100 Simple Letter [class=Warrior]
accept 3101 Consecrated Letter [class=Paladin]
accept 3102 Encrypted Letter [class=Rogue]
accept 3103 Hallowed Letter [class=Priest]
accept 3104 Glyphic Letter [class=Mage]
accept 3105 Tainted Letter [class=Warlock]
accept Brotherhood of Thieves
turnin 3105 Tainted Letter [class=Warlock]
accept 1598 The Stolen Tome [class=Warlock] | Drusilla La Salle.
turnin 3100 Simple Letter [class=Warrior]
turnin 3101 Consecrated Letter [class=Paladin]
turnin 3102 Encrypted Letter [class=Rogue]
turnin 3103 Hallowed Letter [class=Priest]
turnin 3104 Glyphic Letter [class=Mage]
train | Learn your level 2-4 abilities while you are here.
complete Investigate Echo Ridge | Echo Ridge Mine is north of the abbey.
complete Brotherhood of Thieves | Defias Thugs are in the fields east of the abbey.
turnin Investigate Echo Ridge
accept Skirmish at Echo Ridge
turnin Brotherhood of Thieves
accept Bounty on Garrick Padfoot
accept Milly Osworth | Deputy Willem again (Classic: only after Brotherhood of Thieves).
turnin Milly Osworth | Milly is in the vineyard east of the abbey, on the way to the Defias camp.
accept Milly's Harvest
complete Milly's Harvest | Grape buckets in the vineyard.
turnin Milly's Harvest
accept Grape Manifest
complete Bounty on Garrick Padfoot [mark=skull] | Garrick Padfoot is at the Defias camp east of the vineyard.
complete 1598 The Stolen Tome [class=Warlock] | The Stolen Books are at the same Defias camp.
complete Skirmish at Echo Ridge | Kill Kobold Laborers inside Echo Ridge Mine.
turnin Bounty on Garrick Padfoot
turnin Skirmish at Echo Ridge
accept Report to Goldshire
level 5 | Kill kobolds and wolves in the valley if you are short of 5; Goldshire's quests expect it.
turnin Grape Manifest | Brother Neals is at the top of the abbey bell tower.
turnin 1598 The Stolen Tome [class=Warlock]
train | Level 4 abilities.
accept Rest and Relaxation | Falkhaan Isenstrider stands on the road south of the valley.
turnin Report to Goldshire
accept The Fargodeep Mine
accept 5624 Garments of the Light [class=Priest] | Needs level 5. If you are lower, {name} skips it and moves on.
turnin Rest and Relaxation
bind Goldshire [area=87]
accept Kobold Candles
accept Gold Dust Exchange
complete 5624 Garments of the Light [class=Priest]
train | Visit your trainer in Goldshire when you reach level 6.
complete Kobold Candles | Kobolds in and around Fargodeep Mine.
turnin Kobold Candles
complete The Fargodeep Mine | Explore the Fargodeep Mine entrance south of the farms.
turnin The Fargodeep Mine
accept Lost Necklace | "Auntie" Bernice Stonefield is at the Stonefield Farm, south-west of Goldshire.
complete Gold Dust Exchange | Same kobolds; collect Gold Dust.
turnin Lost Necklace | Billy Maclure is at the Maclure Vineyards.
accept Pie for Billy
complete Pie for Billy | Kill boars around the farms for Chunks of Boar Meat.
turnin Pie for Billy
accept Back to Billy
turnin Back to Billy
accept Goldtooth
accept Young Lovers
turnin Young Lovers | Tommy Joe Stonefield is by the stream west of the Stonefield Farm.
accept Speak with Gramma
complete Goldtooth | Goldtooth is deep inside Fargodeep Mine (lower level).
turnin Goldtooth
accept Princess Must Die!
note [hc=only] | Hardcore: Princess (level 9) never fights alone - Porcine Entourage boars stand around her. Pull the guards away one at a time first, or leave her out.
complete Princess Must Die! | Princess is in the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch, south-east of the farms. Bring a friend if you are under level 8.
turnin Princess Must Die!
turnin Speak with Gramma
accept Note to William
turnin Gold Dust Exchange
turnin Note to William
accept Collecting Kelp
turnin 5624 Garments of the Light [class=Priest]
complete Collecting Kelp | Murlocs at Crystal Lake east of Goldshire drop Crystal Kelp Fronds.
turnin Collecting Kelp
accept The Escape
accept 61 Shipment to Stormwind
accept The Jasperlode Mine
accept A Fishy Peril | Remy "Two Times", Goldshire (needs level 7).
turnin A Fishy Peril | Marshal Dughan, a few steps away.
accept Further Concerns
complete The Jasperlode Mine | Explore the Jasperlode Mine, north-east of Goldshire.
turnin Further Concerns | Guard Thomas is on the bridge to Eastvale.
accept Find the Lost Guards
accept Protect the Frontier
turnin Find the Lost Guards
accept Discover Rolf's Fate
turnin Discover Rolf's Fate
accept Report to Thomas
accept A Bundle of Trouble
complete Protect the Frontier | Prowlers and young forest bears in Eastvale.
accept Red Linen Goods | Sara Timberlain is at the Eastvale Logging Camp.
complete Red Linen Goods | Defias around the Eastvale farms drop Red Linen Bandanas.
complete A Bundle of Trouble | Collect Bundles of Wood near the trees of the logging camp.
turnin Red Linen Goods
turnin Protect the Frontier
turnin Report to Thomas
accept Deliver Thomas' Report
accept 184 Furlbrow's Deed [optional]
turnin 184 Furlbrow's Deed [optional] | Turned in at Westfall.
turnin The Escape | Maybell Maclure is at the Maclure Vineyards.
turnin Deliver Thomas' Report
accept Cloth and Leather Armor
turnin The Jasperlode Mine
accept Westbrook Garrison Needs Help!
accept Report to Gryan Stoutmantle | From Marshal Dughan in Goldshire.
accept 1097 Elmore's Task
grind 10 Defias Bandit, Narg the Taskmaster | A Warrior's Training needs level 10: kill these nearby until you reach it.
accept 1638 A Warrior's Training [class=Warrior; optional] | Needs level 10. If you are lower, {name} skips it and moves on.
accept Wanted: "Hogger" [elite; group=3; hc=skip] | The poster is next to Deputy Rainer. Hogger is level 11 elite - group up or skip.
turnin Westbrook Garrison Needs Help! | Deputy Rainer is at the Westbrook Garrison, west Elwynn.
accept Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty
accept 123 The Collector [optional]
complete Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty | Gnolls south of the garrison drop Painted Gnoll Armbands.
turnin Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty
complete Wanted: "Hogger" [elite; group=3; optional; hc=skip]
turnin A Bundle of Trouble
turnin Cloth and Leather Armor | Return to Sara Timberlain only if you are passing Eastvale; otherwise skip.
turnin Wanted: "Hogger" [optional; hc=skip]
turnin 123 The Collector [class=Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage; optional]
turnin 123 The Collector [class=Warlock; optional]
accept 147 Manhunt [class=Warlock; optional]
complete 147 Manhunt [class=Warlock; optional] | The Collector's Ring drops from Morgan the Collector.
turnin 147 Manhunt [class=Warlock; optional]
grind 10 Riverpaw Outrunner, Riverpaw Runt @ south of Westbrook Garrison [at=27.8,81.2] | Only if you are short of level 10: keep killing the bounty gnolls until you ding.
note Stormwind at 10: class quests, training and two deliveries. Take the road north from Goldshire.
accept 2205 Seek out SI: 7 [class=Rogue] | Keryn Sylvius, Goldshire.
accept 1860 Speak with Jennea [class=Mage] | Zaldimar Wefhellt, Goldshire.
accept 5635 Desperate Prayer [class=Priest] | Priestess Josetta, Goldshire.
accept 1685 Gakin's Summons [class=Warlock] | Remen Marcot, Goldshire.
travel Stormwind City
turnin 61 Shipment to Stormwind | Morgan Pestle, Trade District.
turnin 1097 Elmore's Task | Grimand Elmore, Dwarven District.
turnin 1638 A Warrior's Training [class=Warrior] | Harry Burlguard, Old Town.
accept 1639 Bartleby the Drunk [class=Warrior]
turnin 1639 Bartleby the Drunk [class=Warrior] | Bartleby is just outside.
accept 1640 Beat Bartleby [class=Warrior]
complete 1640 Beat Bartleby [class=Warrior] | Fight him until he gives up, then talk to him.
turnin 1640 Beat Bartleby [class=Warrior]
accept 1665 Bartleby's Mug [class=Warrior]
turnin 1665 Bartleby's Mug [class=Warrior] | Back to Harry Burlguard.
accept 1666 Marshal Haggard [class=Warrior]
turnin 2205 Seek out SI: 7 [class=Rogue] | Master Mathias Shaw, SI:7 in Old Town.
turnin 1860 Speak with Jennea [class=Mage] | Jennea Cannon, Mage Quarter.
turnin 5635 Desperate Prayer [class=Priest] | High Priestess Laurena, Cathedral of Light.
turnin 1685 Gakin's Summons [class=Warlock] | Gakin the Darkbinder, Mage Quarter.
accept 1688 Surena Caledon [class=Warlock]
train | Level 10 training.
travel Elwynn Forest
complete 1688 Surena Caledon [class=Warlock] | Surena Caledon carries the choker.
turnin 1666 Marshal Haggard [class=Warrior] | Marshal Haggard, at the farm east of Eastvale Logging Camp.
accept 1667 Dead-tooth Jack [class=Warrior]
complete 1667 Dead-tooth Jack [class=Warrior] | Haggard's Badge is at Dead-tooth Jack's camp.
turnin 1667 Dead-tooth Jack [class=Warrior]
travel Stormwind City [class=Warlock]
turnin 1688 Surena Caledon [class=Warlock]
accept 1689 The Binding [class=Warlock]
complete 1689 The Binding [class=Warlock] | Use the Bloodstone Choker to summon the voidwalker, then defeat it.
turnin 1689 The Binding [class=Warlock]
grind 12 Riverpaw Outrunner, Riverpaw Runt @ south of Westbrook Garrison [at=27.8,81.2] | Classic levels slowly: finish at 12 here before moving on.
note Elwynn is done. Take the road west into Westfall.
